          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: مخلوط کردن",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مخلوط کردن — makhlut kardan — \"to mix\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "makhlut kardan pairs makhlut, borrowed from Arabic maḫlūṭ, \"mixed\" (root ḫ-l-ṭ, Lane), with the Persian verb kardan, \"to do, to make\". kardan, \"to do\", is an inherited verb, from Middle Persian kardan (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
